{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Implemented the safe SQLite migration in `in/db/migration.sql`.\n\nAdded:\n\n- `in/db/preflight_report.md`\n- `in/db/rollback.sql`\n- `in/db/postcheck.sql`\n- `in/db/migration_report.md`\n\nKey behaviors:\n\n- Preserves all 6 users and 4 orders.\n- Preserves every `orders.user_id` reference and historical `created_at`.\n- Cleans dirty emails deterministically:\n  - `u4` → `ada+u4@example.com`\n  - `u5` → `missing+u5@example.invalid`\n  - `u6` → `missing+u6@example.invalid`\n- Adds `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active'`.\n- Enforces non-null unique emails.\n- Rebuilds tables in dependency order inside an explicit transaction.\n- Safe to run twice without duplication or data loss.\n- Rollback restores the old users schema shape while retaining cleaned email values, documented as irreversible cleanup.\n\nVerification passed using SQLite:\n\n- Migration completed successfully.\n- Second migration run preserved identical users and orders.\n- Postcheck script executed successfully.\n- NULL, blank, and duplicate email checks passed.\n- Constraint probes for NULL and duplicate emails failed as expected.\n- Rollback restored columns `id`, `email`, `name`, `created_at` and preserved row counts and order references."}}
